# The EXP CURVE (mp_expcurve.c; the user's design, 2026-11-14) with LEVEL SCALING on: on HOENN's ROUTE 101 (its wild
# POKeMON Lv2-4) a Lv25 POKeMON with no badges is far past the area: 10% EXP (the floor), and a Lv2 one below it is
# boosted. A battle (SWIFT never misses) shows the curve applied. Then HOENN's eight badges are set: in HOENN the
# badge floor rises; in SINNOH and UNOVA the badges counted are theirs (0), never HOENN's (the user: HOENN is never
# the default), and each region's own wild tables are analyzed.
MODE=1
WARP=0,16,10,11
TMO=200
ENV_A="MOEMON_DEBUG_PARTY=6:25,280:2 MOEMON_LEVEL_SCALING=1"
EXPECT_A=("expcurve: active 1 region 0 badges 0" "expcurve: slot 0 Lv25 -> 10%" "expcurve: slot 1 Lv2 -> 1" "exp curve: Lv25, ceiling" "region 0 badges 8" "region 3 badges 0" "region 4 badges 0")
UNEXPECT_A=("[crash]" "TIMEOUT")
